  "body": "Refs #1039 (bubble only; the tap is left for after the capture #126)\nClaim: cloud/i1039-sonnet\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5 (cloud/i1039-sonnet)\nReviewer model: Opus 5.5 (cloud/r1040-opus)\n\n### Problem\nSwiftHFR shows « Message cité N fois » as a text line; legacy shows a speech bubble with the count at the right of the footer.\n\n### Cause\n`TopicHTMLBuilder.trailer` emitted a `<p>` line (parity gap with `LinkItem.m:237-238` @ 87fe0d1c).\n\n### Change\n- `trailer(of:)` renders `<span class=\"quoted-bubble\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Message cité N fois\">N</span>`; the text line is gone. The edit note stays a line.\n- `reader.css`: bubble at the right of the footer, drawn in CSS from theme tokens (legacy used the `08-chat.png` image), a slightly rounded speech shape.\n- **No tap yet, on purpose (AGENTS.md §3.1):** legacy's `quotedLINK` is the `quote_only=1` link (`ParseMessagesOperation.m:254-257`); what it returns is in neither legacy code nor any fixture (HFR-PROTOCOL §7 E2 / B11: \"not captured\", third-party source only). LOT-093's filtered flow filters by count/pseudo, not by message. So the bubble is inert text, not an anchor. Capture issue already open: #126 (`host: mac`). The tap and its test follow once #126 lands; #1039 stays open.\n\n### Tests\n`TopicHTMLBuilderTests`: `trailersAndAvatar` (bubble carries count and label, old line gone; fails on the old code), `theBubbleIsNotALink` (fails on the old code), `aMessageNeverQuotedHasNoBubble` (regression guard only: passes without the change, now also checks no empty footer). Not run here (Linux cloud session, the app target cannot build): CI compile-check is the arbiter. `swiftlint --strict` is clean on the changed files.\n\n### Ledger\n\n```gap-edit\nGAP-055\nSwiftHFR final: 2 px left border, no fill (a gallery theme may add one), 4 px before the text, 5 px below, as legacy; \"me\", whitelist and blocklist variants tinted; \"Message cité N fois\" as a count bubble at the right of the message footer (#1039, `LinkItem.m:237-238` @ 87fe0d1c), not a link yet (`quote_only=1` not captured, #126).\n```\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CEAT7FUH4gujFVQ6TK",
